# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 🇪🇸 ES — Qué es este archivo
#   Git usa .gitignore para saber qué archivos NO debe versionar.
#   Aquí excluimos bases de datos generadas, logs crudos y dependencias.
#   La regla del proyecto: el conocimiento PROCESADO se versiona,
#   los binarios regenerables NO (se pueden reconstruir con `genesis process`).
# 🇬🇧 EN — What this file is
#   Git reads .gitignore to know which files must NOT be versioned.
#   We exclude generated databases, raw logs and dependencies.
#   Project rule: PROCESSED knowledge is versioned, regenerable binaries are NOT
#   (they can be rebuilt with `genesis process`).
# 🇧🇷 PT — O que é este arquivo
#   O Git lê o .gitignore para saber quais arquivos NÃO versionar.
#   Excluímos bancos gerados, logs brutos e dependências.
#   Regra do projeto: conhecimento PROCESSADO é versionado, binários
#   regeneráveis NÃO (podem ser recriados com `genesis process`).
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# --- Dependencies / Dependências -------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js

# --- Build output / Salida de build / Saída de build ------------------------
dist/
build/
out/
.next/
.nuxt/
.output/
.turbo/
.parcel-cache/
.vite/
.svelte-kit/
coverage/

# --- Generated databases & indexes (rebuildable) ----------------------------
data/indexes/*.db
data/indexes/*.db-journal
data/indexes/*.db-wal
data/indexes/*.db-shm
data/indexes/*.sqlite
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# --- Raw capture: local-only by default, samples are versioned --------------
data/raw/**
!data/raw/
!data/raw/**/
!data/raw/**/.gitkeep
data/processed/runtime/

# --- Runtime logs & OS noise ------------------------------------------------
*.log
logs/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Environments / Entornos / Ambientes ------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Editor / IDE -----------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# --- Python (future automation adapters) ------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
